### Next Steps
This task enforces JWT on endpoints but does not implement token generation/issuance. The authentication system (login, token generation) will be implemented in a follow-up task. Currently, the API will reject all requests to protected endpoints until valid JWT tokens are issued by an auth system.

### Related Tasks
- T-002: Implement org isolation using `req.orgId` from JWT
- T-003: Implement JWT-based authentication system (login, token generation)
- T-004: Fix CORS to production allowlist

### Security Impact
- ✅ Eliminates anonymous access to all organization data
- ✅ Provides foundation for org-based multi-tenancy
- ✅ Enables audit trail via `req.userId` in logs
- ⚠️ Requires JWT_SECRET to be set in production environments
